    "カーソルがボールより上だとゴロ、真ん中だとライナー、少し下だと柵越えの出やすいフライ、下すぎるとポップフライ" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cursor above the ball: grounder. Dead center: line drive. A little below: a fly ball with homer potential. Way below: pop-up"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "カーソルを左に置くと左へ、右に置くと右へ。早く振ると左、遅く振ると右にも寄ります。寄せすぎるとファウル" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Put the cursor left to hit left, right to hit right. Swinging early also pulls it left, and late pushes it right. Too far and it's foul"
